7:["$","p",null,{"children":"Admissibility is evaluated before profitability. All three books must be present, synchronized within the registered freshness tolerance, deep enough for the requested amount, and compatible with venue precision and minimum-order rules. Missing or stale legs invalidate the route; they are never filled from a previous snapshot. Public scanning needs no API key and remains separated from authenticated execution state."}]
