t" style="height:0.247em;"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class="mclose"><span class="delimsizing mult"><span class="vlist-t vlist-t2"><span class="vlist-r"><span class="vlist" style="height:1.15em;"><span style="top:-3.15em;"><span class="pstrut" style="height:3.8em;"></span><span style="width:0.333em;height:1.8em;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="0.333em" height="1.8em" viewBox="0 0 333 1800"><path d="M145 15 v585 v600 v585 c2.667,10,9.667,15,21,15
